    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Magical Delicacy is a combat-free Metroidvania-lite with a complex cooking system. Set foot in Grat and <strong>get lost while platforming through this twisted town</strong> - find and explore open pathways or <strong>fulfill the complex orders of the townsfolk</strong> to progress and unlock new kitchen tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Platforming and exploration lie at the heart of Magical Delicacy and are required to collect ingredients and progress within the game. Toggle the Easy Platforming mode in the settings if you want a more comfortable platforming experience or have trouble with challenging passages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/8c0592bd8cc544fd09da3aef2cbe4410.poster.avif?t=1754326933\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/8c0592bd8cc544fd09da3aef2cbe4410.webm?t=1754326933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/8c0592bd8cc544fd09da3aef2cbe4410.mp4?t=1754326933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the young witch Flora and discover a bustling town in this Metroidvania-inspired wholesome cooking game. Cook meals and potions in your customized kitchen by carefully selecting the right ingredients. Navigate the town in casual platforming to meet the townsfolk, take up their orders, and learn about this world of magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flora travels to a distant town to fulfill her dream of becoming a proper witch. She opens up shop in Grat, a harbor town built upon cliffs, where adventurers settled to chart an unexplored island full of mystery. As she engages in the town\u2019s thriving economy, she stumbles upon two members of opposing covens. The witch Cassia and the magus Tauno have a lot to teach Flora, but they also know how to use her in their dispute about magical beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/b6d08659837e9f89d232bab6a1b7b46d.poster.avif?t=1754326933\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/b6d08659837e9f89d232bab6a1b7b46d.webm?t=1754326933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/b6d08659837e9f89d232bab6a1b7b46d.mp4?t=1754326933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit a beautiful harbor town, a densely packed space with people to meet, history to discover, and many opportunities to improve your business. <strong>Shop at merchants</strong> to buy various keepsakes and upgrades. <strong>Accept dozens of orders</strong> from the townsfolk asking for your magical food. Meet mysterious travelers, shop owners, forgotten legends, and masters of their crafts, some of which might only appear during day or night. Unravel long-forgotten secrets of the island and its mystical creatures.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/687e5d7026de3f38b351e2f0ba44ecaf.avif?t=1754326933\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/220887ed78b839c0464bf09b27636790.poster.avif?t=1754326933\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/220887ed78b839c0464bf09b27636790.webm?t=1754326933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/220887ed78b839c0464bf09b27636790.mp4?t=1754326933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RESOURCE MANAGEMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cooking delicious meals for your customers requires the correct ingredients. <strong>Gather ingredients</strong> directly within the nooks and crannies of the town, while some other ingredients can only be <strong>bought from merchants</strong>. Run out of an ingredient while cooking? Don\u2019t worry - merchants will restock their shops, and forgeable ingredients eventually grow back with a little patience. Upgrade your kitchen to stash a collection of ingredients ready for cooking and experimentation or sell them to merchants for Beads, your precious currency for trading.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/3e31fa543c70787f2ed3da1f41a5df8b.avif?t=1754326933\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/566079e1e055c76749d93fce53f2ab61.poster.avif?t=1754326933\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/566079e1e055c76749d93fce53f2ab61.webm?t=1754326933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/566079e1e055c76749d93fce53f2ab61.mp4?t=1754326933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>COOKING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use <strong>your acquired ingredients</strong> to create magical dishes. Different attributes require you to think about your ingredient selection. <strong>Figure out and learn</strong> how flavors mix and how to meet customers\u2018 odd and complex requests for food. Closely <strong>follow recipes or experiment with your own creations</strong>, then <strong>sell or deliver</strong> your potions, meals, teas, and pastries to friends and customers. Be it local cuisine or Flora\u2019s hometown recipes, everything to satisfy the tastebuds of different folks, from the croaking Gaball to the feline Tilin.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/3b5e7ff0e6fa45e355b3e4639fe0864a.avif?t=1754326933\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/f6a33a9e6233e114f57f3395df4ba524.poster.avif?t=1754326933\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/f6a33a9e6233e114f57f3395df4ba524.webm?t=1754326933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/f6a33a9e6233e114f57f3395df4ba524.mp4?t=1754326933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KITCHEN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start with basic equipment and <strong>acquire new kitchen tools</strong>. Unlock more rooms to arrange and customize your tools to your liking and maximize efficiency when cooking. Put your unused creations up for sale, sort your ingredients into storage, and <strong>grow some plants in the backyard.</strong> It would be the perfect place to call your own if it wasn\u2019t for this unwanted roommate and a lingering capitalist dread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/a0ef64eaecba40bf1b63c5fb1166bd01.avif?t=1754326933\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/99d969d94c07dd73492f0668daaa82b5.poster.avif?t=1754326933\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/99d969d94c07dd73492f0668daaa82b5.webm?t=1754326933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/99d969d94c07dd73492f0668daaa82b5.mp4?t=1754326933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PLATFORMING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate the town during your deliveries, climb bell towers and old ramparts, or delve through challenging old catacombs. Grow as a witch and acquire <strong>upgrades to your movement abilities</strong> to discover new routes and hard-to-reach places or open shortcuts that lead back to your store. Uncover and learn the twisted pathways on the map and remember the whereabouts of the townsfolk. Inspired by the Metroidvania genre and condensed into a cozy cooking game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/e8a210f5e625230d8acd57b66b1b7a84.avif?t=1754326933\" /></div><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Enchanting <strong>pixel art</strong> style depicting a fantastical world of witches and magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Befriend <strong>a cast of diverse characters</strong> that love to order food from you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Traverse a <strong>2D platformer</strong> inspired by Metroidvanias. Gain new abilities, reach new areas, and unlock shortcuts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Learn an <strong>extensive cooking system</strong>, allowing for creative choices to fulfill even oddly specific orders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Collect ingredients</strong> and new recipes through trade, questing, and exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Intertwined <strong>progression</strong> requiring map exploration and delivering orders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Linear story</strong> with optional encounters and opportunities for open-ended play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Plenty of <strong>accessibility features</strong> to help you experience the game on your own terms, including an Easy Platforming mode that disables various challenges.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Magical Delicacy is a combat-free Metroidvania-lite with a complex cooking system. Set foot in Grat and <strong>get lost while platforming through this twisted town</strong> - find and explore open pathways or <strong>fulfill the complex orders of the townsfolk</strong> to progress and unlock new kitchen tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Platforming and exploration lie at the heart of Magical Delicacy and are required to collect ingredients and progress within the game. Toggle the Easy Platforming mode in the settings if you want a more comfortable platforming experience or have trouble with challenging passages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/8c0592bd8cc544fd09da3aef2cbe4410.poster.avif?t=1754326933\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/8c0592bd8cc544fd09da3aef2cbe4410.webm?t=1754326933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/8c0592bd8cc544fd09da3aef2cbe4410.mp4?t=1754326933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the young witch Flora and discover a bustling town in this Metroidvania-inspired wholesome cooking game. Cook meals and potions in your customized kitchen by carefully selecting the right ingredients. Navigate the town in casual platforming to meet the townsfolk, take up their orders, and learn about this world of magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flora travels to a distant town to fulfill her dream of becoming a proper witch. She opens up shop in Grat, a harbor town built upon cliffs, where adventurers settled to chart an unexplored island full of mystery. As she engages in the town\u2019s thriving economy, she stumbles upon two members of opposing covens. The witch Cassia and the magus Tauno have a lot to teach Flora, but they also know how to use her in their dispute about magical beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/b6d08659837e9f89d232bab6a1b7b46d.poster.avif?t=1754326933\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/b6d08659837e9f89d232bab6a1b7b46d.webm?t=1754326933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/b6d08659837e9f89d232bab6a1b7b46d.mp4?t=1754326933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit a beautiful harbor town, a densely packed space with people to meet, history to discover, and many opportunities to improve your business. <strong>Shop at merchants</strong> to buy various keepsakes and upgrades. <strong>Accept dozens of orders</strong> from the townsfolk asking for your magical food. Meet mysterious travelers, shop owners, forgotten legends, and masters of their crafts, some of which might only appear during day or night. Unravel long-forgotten secrets of the island and its mystical creatures.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/687e5d7026de3f38b351e2f0ba44ecaf.avif?t=1754326933\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/220887ed78b839c0464bf09b27636790.poster.avif?t=1754326933\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/220887ed78b839c0464bf09b27636790.webm?t=1754326933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/220887ed78b839c0464bf09b27636790.mp4?t=1754326933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RESOURCE MANAGEMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cooking delicious meals for your customers requires the correct ingredients. <strong>Gather ingredients</strong> directly within the nooks and crannies of the town, while some other ingredients can only be <strong>bought from merchants</strong>. Run out of an ingredient while cooking? Don\u2019t worry - merchants will restock their shops, and forgeable ingredients eventually grow back with a little patience. Upgrade your kitchen to stash a collection of ingredients ready for cooking and experimentation or sell them to merchants for Beads, your precious currency for trading.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/3e31fa543c70787f2ed3da1f41a5df8b.avif?t=1754326933\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/566079e1e055c76749d93fce53f2ab61.poster.avif?t=1754326933\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/566079e1e055c76749d93fce53f2ab61.webm?t=1754326933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/566079e1e055c76749d93fce53f2ab61.mp4?t=1754326933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>COOKING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use <strong>your acquired ingredients</strong> to create magical dishes. Different attributes require you to think about your ingredient selection. <strong>Figure out and learn</strong> how flavors mix and how to meet customers\u2018 odd and complex requests for food. Closely <strong>follow recipes or experiment with your own creations</strong>, then <strong>sell or deliver</strong> your potions, meals, teas, and pastries to friends and customers. Be it local cuisine or Flora\u2019s hometown recipes, everything to satisfy the tastebuds of different folks, from the croaking Gaball to the feline Tilin.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/3b5e7ff0e6fa45e355b3e4639fe0864a.avif?t=1754326933\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/f6a33a9e6233e114f57f3395df4ba524.poster.avif?t=1754326933\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/f6a33a9e6233e114f57f3395df4ba524.webm?t=1754326933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/f6a33a9e6233e114f57f3395df4ba524.mp4?t=1754326933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KITCHEN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start with basic equipment and <strong>acquire new kitchen tools</strong>. Unlock more rooms to arrange and customize your tools to your liking and maximize efficiency when cooking. Put your unused creations up for sale, sort your ingredients into storage, and <strong>grow some plants in the backyard.</strong> It would be the perfect place to call your own if it wasn\u2019t for this unwanted roommate and a lingering capitalist dread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/a0ef64eaecba40bf1b63c5fb1166bd01.avif?t=1754326933\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/99d969d94c07dd73492f0668daaa82b5.poster.avif?t=1754326933\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/99d969d94c07dd73492f0668daaa82b5.webm?t=1754326933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/99d969d94c07dd73492f0668daaa82b5.mp4?t=1754326933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PLATFORMING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate the town during your deliveries, climb bell towers and old ramparts, or delve through challenging old catacombs. Grow as a witch and acquire <strong>upgrades to your movement abilities</strong> to discover new routes and hard-to-reach places or open shortcuts that lead back to your store. Uncover and learn the twisted pathways on the map and remember the whereabouts of the townsfolk. Inspired by the Metroidvania genre and condensed into a cozy cooking game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231190/extras/e8a210f5e625230d8acd57b66b1b7a84.avif?t=1754326933\" /></div><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Enchanting <strong>pixel art</strong> style depicting a fantastical world of witches and magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Befriend <strong>a cast of diverse characters</strong> that love to order food from you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Traverse a <strong>2D platformer</strong> inspired by Metroidvanias. Gain new abilities, reach new areas, and unlock shortcuts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Learn an <strong>extensive cooking system</strong>, allowing for creative choices to fulfill even oddly specific orders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Collect ingredients</strong> and new recipes through trade, questing, and exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Intertwined <strong>progression</strong> requiring map exploration and delivering orders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Linear story</strong> with optional encounters and opportunities for open-ended play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Plenty of <strong>accessibility features</strong> to help you experience the game on your own terms, including an Easy Platforming mode that disables various challenges.</p></li></ul>",
